   "line": [
    "e3"
   ],
   "spoken": "The modest pawn to e3 braces the centre — and crucially, don't capture on c5. Holding the tension is part of the Jobava's venom.",
   "kind": "plan"
  },
  {
   "ply": 8,
   "t": 1162.5,
   "fen": "r1bqkb1r/pp2pppp/2n2n2/2pp4/3P1B2/2N1P3/PPP2PPP/R2QKBNR w KQkq - 1 5",
