   "line": [
    "Nc3"
   ],
   "spoken": "When the opponent counterattacks the knight, don't overthink it — the simplest path is to note that the d-pawn is weak and just retreat the knight to c3, hitting the enemy knight. If it moves, the pawn falls, and the opponent is left two pawns down.",
   "kind": "plan"
  },
