   "fen": "r1b1kb1r/1p3p1p/p1n2p2/2p5/2B2B2/2P1P3/P1P2PPP/2KR2NR b - - 1 12",
   "line": [
    "Bc4"
   ],
   "spoken": "Now read the opponent's intentions — the light-squared bishop wants to reach e6 and target the sensitive a2 pawn. Pre-empt it by developing the bishop to c4, so a clever answer is ready if the bishop comes out.",
   "kind": "plan"
  },
  {
