   "fen": "r3kbr1/1p3p1p/p1n1bp2/2pB4/5B2/2P1P1P1/P1P2P1P/2KR2NR b - - 0 14",
   "line": [
    "g3"
   ],
   "spoken": "Defend the deep bishop with a modest pawn move — it looks ungainly, but the point is that the bishop simply cannot be attacked, so its apparent entombment is no problem at all. A piece that can't be challenged is safe wherever it sits.",
   "kind": "plan"
  },
  {
