   "t": 1421,
   "fen": "3rkbr1/1p3p1p/p3bp2/2pB4/1nP1PB2/6P1/P1P2P1P/2KR2NR b - - 0 16",
   "line": [
    "e4"
   ],
   "spoken": "The priority when the bishop is attacked is to preserve it, not the pawn — because moving it would allow a knight check that pries the king away from the rook. So push in the centre, conceding the pawn but keeping the monster bishop, which is worth far more.",
   "kind": "tactic"
  },
  {
