   "line": [
    "Bxe5",
    "fxe5",
    "Rhd1"
   ],
   "spoken": "Should the knight be taken? Yes — and don't say no just because the question is posed. Look how lame the opponent's bishop becomes, staring blankly into its own pawns, while the capture wins a tempo and lets the rooks double. Sometimes the obvious trade is simply best.",
   "kind": "plan"
