   "line": [
    "R1d2"
   ],
   "spoken": "The natural pawn move would rebound — it lets the bishop retreat and suddenly a pawn goes weak and gets won. Resist the reactionary reply and instead block calmly with the rook, gaining a tempo. Learning to make these unintuitive prophylactic moves is exactly what many players struggle with.",
   "kind": "plan"
